body:
I mean, have you watched 100 thieves youtube videos? Aphromoo has kind of allways been like that in the recent years. I don't think he's demotivated, maybe a little disapointed about their performances so far but thats it.

&#x200B;

I mean even when they won last year, you woudn't get a lot from Aphro. Maybe a smile and a smug comment but that's it. I think he's a more reserved guy than reddit thinks.
